1. 1D Array slicing & independence:
Original:
[10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
Slice:
[20, 30, 40]
After slice mutation - Original:
[10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
After slice mutation - Slice:
[999, 30, 40]
2. 2D Matrix row slicing:
Matrix row slice:
[[1, 2], [3, 4]]
After inner element mutation on matrix:
[777, 2]
3. Boundary & zero-length slicing:
Empty array slice:
[]
Zero length slice:
[]
Start greater than end:
[]